@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@accessToken = YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN

### 1. Gửi yêu cầu tư vấn (Public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/consultations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "guest_name": "Test User",
    "guest_phone": "0123456789",
    "guest_email": "test@gmail.com",
    "course_of_interest": "IELTS Masterclass",
    "inquiry_details": "I would like to ask about the course"
}

### 2. Lấy danh sách yêu cầu tư vấn (Staff)
GET {{baseUrl}}/consultations/staff?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Cập nhật yêu cầu tư vấn (Staff)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/consultations/staff/REPLACE_WITH_UUID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "Contacted",
    "call_notes": "Called and consulted about the course details"
}
